Licenses for the fonts Trimpod ships.  Three faces are distributed: ChicagoFLF
(the UI font, as 18/20/24px Rockbox .fnt rasterizations), the PixelMplus
Japanese glyphs merged into the 24px .fnt, and Schumacher Clean (the fallback
system font, compiled into the binary from 08-Schumacher-Clean.bdf).

----- ChicagoFLF (18/20/24-ChicagoFLF.fnt) ----

ChicagoFLF by Robin Casady, a reproduction of Susan Kare's Chicago.
Released by the author into the public domain.

----- PixelMplus (Japanese glyphs merged into 24-ChicagoFLF.fnt) ----

The Japanese (kana/kanji/fullwidth) glyphs in 24-ChicagoFLF.fnt are rasterized
from PixelMplus12-Regular by Itou Hiroki (https://github.com/itouhiro/PixelMplus),
a pixel-style outline conversion of the M+ bitmap fonts.
Copyright (C) 2013 M+ Font Project.  Distributed under the M+ FONT LICENSE:

M+ FONTS                                Copyright (C) 2002-2013 M+ FONTS PROJECT

These fonts are free software.
Unlimited permission is granted to use, copy, and distribute them, with
or without modification, either commercially or noncommercially.
THESE FONTS ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTY.

http://mplus-fonts.sourceforge.jp/mplus-outline-fonts/

